−</sup></span> = <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=6,7</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">18</span> <span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span> : <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">4,1</span> ; <span class=\"m\">3,5</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,9</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,1</span>. <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>1</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">19</span> <span class=\"ce\">[Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>4</sub>=12,6</span>, <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>3</sub>=10,5</span> : p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,4</sub></span> (perte d'un ligand) ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">20</span> <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sub>4</sub><sup>2−</sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>4</sub>=15,1</span>, <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>3</sub>=14,1</span> : p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,4</sub></span> (perte d'un ligand) ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">21</span> <span class=\"ce\">[Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> + <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span> = <span class=\"ce\">[Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=3,5</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">22</span> <span class=\"ce\">CdI<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span> + <span class=\"ce\">I<sup>−</sup></span> = <span class=\"ce\">CdI<sub>2</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=1,3</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">23</span> <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span> + <span class=\"ce\">Cl<sup>−</sup></span> = <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sub>2</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=6,5</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">24</span> <span class=\"ce\">Fe<sup>3<sup>+</sup></sup></span> + <span class=\"ce\">SCN<sup>−</sup></span> = <span class=\"ce\">[FeSCN]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=2,1</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">25</span> <span class=\"ce\">[Ag(NH<sub>3</sub>)]<sup><sup>+</sup></sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>1</sub>=3,30</span> : p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,1</sub></span> (perte d'un ligand) ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">26</span> <span class=\"ce\">[FeSCN]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>1</sub>=2,10</span> : p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,1</sub></span> (perte d'un ligand) ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">27</span> <span class=\"ce\">[Ag(S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>]<sup>3−</sup></span> : <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>2</sub>=13,5</span>, <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>1</sub>=8,80</span> : p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,2</sub></span> (perte d'un ligand) ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">28</span> <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sub>2</sub></span> + <span class=\"ce\">Cl<sup>−</sup></span> = <span class=\"ce\">HgCl<sub>3</sub><sup>−</sup></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f</sub>=0,90</span> : constante de dissociation <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub></span> ?</li></ul> ","corrige":"<p class=\"q\">Résultats :</p><ul class=\"en\"><li><span class=\"num\">15</span> <span class=\"m\">logβ<sub>5</sub>=∑<sub>j≤5</sub>logK<sub>f,j</sub>=8,70</span> : <span class=\"ce\">Ni<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> + 5 <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span> = <span class=\"ce\">[Ni(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>5</sub>]<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span></li><li><span class=\"num\">16</span> p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d,3</sub>=logβ<sub>3</sub>−logβ<sub>2</sub>=1,0</span></li><li><span class=\"num\">17</span> <span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub>=1/K<sub>f</sub>=10<sup>−6,7</sup>=2,00·10<sup>−7</sup></span> ; p<span class=\"m\">K<sub>d</sub>