édomine à p<span class=\"m\">L</span> plus petit).</p><ul class=\"en\"><li><span class=\"num\">29</span> <span class=\"ce\">Cd<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">I<sup>−</sup></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">2,1</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,3</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,0</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,3</span> : espèce prédominante à pI <span class=\"m\">=3,0</span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">30</span> <span class=\"ce\">Ni<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">2,8</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,2</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,7</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,2</span> ; <span class=\"m\">0,80</span> ; <span class=\"m\">0</span> : espèce prédominante à pNH<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span> <span class=\"m\">=1,9</span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">31</span> <span class=\"ce\">Cu<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">4,1</span> ; <span class=\"m\">3,5</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,9</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,1</span> : espèce prédominante à pNH<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span> <span class=\"m\">=3,0</span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">32</span> <span class=\"ce\">Ni<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">2,8</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,2</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,7</span> ; <span class=\"m\">1,2</span> ; <span class=\"m\">0,80</span> ; <span class=\"m\">0</span> : espèce prédominante à pNH<span class=\"m\"><sub>3</sub></span> <span class=\"m\">=0,90</span> ?</li><li><span class=\"num\">33</span> <span class=\"ce\">Zn<sup>2<sup>+</sup></sup></span> / <span class=\"ce\">NH<sub>3</sub></span>, <span class=\"m\">logK<sub>f,j</sub>=</span> <span class=\"m\">2,4</span> ; <span class=\"m\">2,4</span> ; <span class